        },
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_WU7hF3": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What influences diamond colour?",
            "text": "<p>White diamonds are formed from carbon atoms arranged in a crystal structure. In coloured diamonds, distinctive hues can develop when trace elements, natural structural distortions, or environmental conditions affect the stone as it forms. Pressure, temperature, and natural radiation can all contribute to these colour variations.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
            "text_size_mobile": 14,
            "padding_left_mobile": 40,
            "padding_right_mobile": 40,
            "spacing_mobile": 20,
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "text_color": "#000000"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_8322f0f_VjxUe3": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_8322f0f",
          "settings": {
            "padding_top_desktop": 0,
            "padding_bottom_desktop": 25,
            "padding_top_mobile": 5,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_0029bb1_Ptaji8": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_0029bb1",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Coloured diamond grading",
            "text": "<p>Natural coloured diamonds are extremely rare, particularly those with strong, vivid colour. Assessing them requires specialised grading, with the Gemological Institute of America (GIA) evaluating coloured diamonds by the strength and character of their colour, from subtle tones through to Fancy Deep.</p><p>Among the most sought-after are Fancy Vivid diamonds, prized for their powerful, saturated colour and remarkable rarity.</p>",
            "heading_size_desktop": 30,
            "text_size_desktop": 18,
            "padding_left_desktop": 380,
            "padding_right_desktop": 380,
            "spacing_desktop": 40,
            "heading_size_mobile": 20,
